<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank reserves firm to $3.635 bln - Sept 1.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank reserves firm to $3.635 bln - Sept 1.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) on Monday said its hard currency reserves firmed to $3.635 billion as of September 11, from $3.605 billion on September 4.</p>
<p> HARD CURRENCY RESERVES     Sept 11  Sept 4   Sept '95</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)	 3.635    3.605    2.825</p>
<p>  Commercial banks	    1.210    1.254    1.581</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector     4.845    4.859    4.406</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3687</p>
</text>
